\uc1\pard\qc\f0\fs20 A memory-first terminal for agentic coding.\par
\pard\sa60\par
\b Getting started\b0\par
New tab \u8984?T, split right \u8984?D, split down \u8679?\u8984?D. Or the prefix Ctrl+a, then c, | or -.\par
Run an agent: \f1 pinfold agent <name>\f0  in a pane opens a split running the profile \f1 [agents.<name>]\f0  from your config.\par
Open a project: \f1 pinfold up\f0  in a directory opens its \f1 .pinfold/layout.toml\f0 .\par
Agents: {\cf1 \u9670?} needs you  {\cf2 \u9679?} running  {\cf3 \u10003?} done  {\cf4 \u10005?} error  {\cf5 \u9675?} idle\par
\par
\b Files\b0\par
Config: \f1 ~/.config/pinfold/pinfold.toml\f0 . PinFold > Settings\u8230? opens it.\par
Log: \f1 $TMPDIR/pinfold-$(id -u)/default.log\f0\par
